<![CDATA[{!Contact.FirstName},<br><br>Thank you for your interest in Arizona State University's master's in history program through the School of Historical, Philosophical and Religious Studies. We are excited that you are considering joining the ASU community. Here is some information to get you started on your journey:<br><br><b>Tempe Program:<br></b><br><a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/programs/t5/majorinfo/ASU00/LAHISTMA/graduate/false">Program description and admission requirements</a><br><a href="https://shprs.clas.asu.edu/graduate/history">Information regarding history graduate studies</a><br><br><b>Online Program:</b><br><br><a href="https://shprs.clas.asu.edu/graduate/history-master-arts-degree-online">Program description and admission requirements</a><br><a href="http://asuonline.asu.edu/">ASU general online program information</a><br><br><b>Accelerated Program:</b><br><br><a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/programs/t5/programs/Accelerate/all/undergrad/false">Accelerated program information</a><br><br>Please review these documents closely, and contact me at <a href="mailto:Roxanne.Shand@asu.edu">Roxanne.Shand@asu.edu</a> with any additional questions you may have.<br><br>Sincerely,<br><br>Roxanne Shand<br>Graduate Program Coordinator<br>School of Historical, Philosophical and Religious Studies<br>College of Liberal Arts and Sciences<br>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>